{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はじょしらく チームご 4公演目でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の落語はざきさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お誕生日のざきさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の主役はざきさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はざきさんのことを、この期間で\nいろいろ知りました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までも、もちろんいろいろ知ってたけど\n性格や中身をより知りました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたも一緒に頑張ろうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちは5人でじょしらくだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざきだいすき！みんなだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今心配なのは\nセリフ間違えるとかそういうことじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくロスにかかるんじゃないかなと\n心配です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくロスって結構重いんだよ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくキツイんだよ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、実際\nじょしらくロスから解放されたの\nじょしらく弍やるって聞いてからなんだよね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー、終わりたくない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わるからこそ\nその瞬間が楽しくて幸せで悲しくて寂しくて、輝くんだと思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、終わりたくないって思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのくらい、ちゃんと私は\nじょしらくに向き合えていたんだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのあの一瞬一瞬は\nどう感じるんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前の景色や\n目に映るものはどう見えるんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てとちゃん、がんちゃん、まりいさん、くくるちゃんの言葉を\nきぐちゃんとして受け取って\n私もみんなに届けられるように\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき！じょしらく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき！チームご！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/21/4137128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今だけ同い年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/21/4137128/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/21/4137128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！今日のあのシーンで\n写真を撮ってくださる\n「おめぐたん」が小樽出身！！！と言っていたんですが、\n私も小樽出身なんですが\nとなり町だったの！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、楽屋では\n小樽トークをしたりしてたんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって、じょしらくに立候補して\nじょしらくをやらせてもらえてなかったら\n出会うことができなかった人がいて\n私は幸せなことに、おめぐたんや\nいろいろなスタッフさんと出会うことができて\n本当に幸せに思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小樽トークたのしかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、いつか一緒に小樽観光したいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめぐたんと、ミルク・プラントで\nアイス食べたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/21/4137128/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわー！寂しい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対楽しいもん！！！"}],"source":"archive"}